1398
01:02:53.200 --> 01:03:02.500
Now he has this huge task where he has to go make this very public apology to his coworkers, and they have to sign that they received his apology.
现在他有一项艰巨的任务，他必须向同事们公开道歉，而且他们必须签字确认收到了他的道歉。

1399
01:03:02.860 --> 01:03:03.300
Yes.
是的。

1400
01:03:03.500 --> 01:03:05.760
That's going to be now Dwight's task.
那现在就是德怀特的任务了。

1401
01:03:06.180 --> 01:03:14.460
Meanwhile, we've got this very interesting, somewhat odd other storyline that's going to come up.
与此同时，我们还有一条非常有趣、甚至有点古怪的支线剧情要登场。

1402
01:03:14.600 --> 01:03:16.840
It really seems like it comes out of nowhere.
它看起来确实有点突如其来。

1403
01:03:17.440 --> 01:03:18.480
It's in the break room.
故事发生在休息室里。

1404
01:03:18.720 --> 01:03:23.740
Andy, I guess, is really good at pirating movies, so you can see them before they come out.
安迪，我猜，他很擅长盗版电影，所以你能在他那儿看到还没上映的片子。

1405
01:03:24.040 --> 01:03:28.700
And Jim and Pam are going to watch this movie with Andy on his laptop.
吉姆和帕姆打算在安迪的笔记本电脑上一起看这部电影。

1406
01:03:29.460 --> 01:03:29.860
Yes.
没错。

1407
01:03:30.160 --> 01:03:33.020
We got a lot of fan mail about this pirated movie scene.
我们收到了很多关于这段盗版电影戏份的粉丝来信。

1408
01:03:33.580 --> 01:03:36.040
Hannah E., Abby S., and Bet S.
汉娜·E、艾比·S 和贝特·S

1409
01:03:36.240 --> 01:03:36.660
said,
她们说，

1410
01:03:36.660 --> 01:03:43.460
I am absolutely obsessed with the strange mini-movie Andy watches with Jack Black and several other big names.
我简直着迷于安迪看的那部奇怪的微电影，里面有杰克·布莱克和其他几位大牌明星。

1411
01:03:43.680 --> 01:03:45.900
How did this subplot come about?
这个支线剧情是怎么来的呢？

1412
01:03:46.260 --> 01:03:47.940
Does it rhyme with Schmooper Bowl?
是不是和“超级碗”押韵？

1413
01:03:48.300 --> 01:03:49.180
It does.
确实是。

1414
01:03:49.440 --> 01:03:50.500
It does.
没错。

1415
01:03:50.920 --> 01:03:53.380
Remember when I said there was that extra scrutiny?
还记得我说过有额外的审查吗？

1416
01:03:53.940 --> 01:04:01.160
Well, one of the things that the network was very insistent about was that this episode have big-name guest stars.
嗯，电视网非常坚持的一点就是，这一集必须有大牌客串明星。

1417
01:04:01.160 --> 01:04:06.260
So they could flash it about Jack Black, Jessica Alba.
这样他们就能拿杰克·布莱克、杰西卡·阿尔芭来做宣传。

1418
01:04:06.780 --> 01:04:07.060
Yes.
是的。

1419
01:04:07.360 --> 01:04:14.100
There was a lot of comparison to when other shows had run after the Super Bowl, like Friends, who had featured big guest stars.
当时很多人拿我们和那些在“超级碗”之后播出的剧集做比较，比如《老友记》，他们就请过大牌客串。

1420
01:04:14.100 --> 01:04:19.480
But Greg and the rest of our writers were very against this.
但格雷格和我们其他的编剧都非常反对这样做。

1421
01:04:20.480 --> 01:04:24.420
Especially against it was Alison Jones, our casting director.
我们的选角导演艾莉森·琼斯尤其反对。

1422
01:04:24.780 --> 01:04:27.060
They all felt that to have, like,
他们都觉得，如果让

1423
01:04:27.060 --> 01:04:37.620
a big-name guest star walk into the office pretending to play a character at a small paper company would just totally shatter the reality of the documentary premise of our show.
一个大牌明星走进办公室，假装成一家小造纸公司的员工，会彻底破坏我们剧集纪录片形式的真实感。

1424
01:04:37.620 --> 01:04:44.420
We would get all these new eyes on the episode, maybe, but the conceit of our show is that it's a documentary.
也许我们能借此吸引到新观众，但我们剧集的核心设定是纪录片。

1425
01:04:44.900 --> 01:04:45.360
That's right.
没错。

1426
01:04:45.480 --> 01:04:48.160
You can't have Jack Black come in and pretend to be a salesman.
你不能让杰克·布莱克跑进来假装是个销售员。

1427
01:04:48.580 --> 01:04:49.100
Exactly.
确实如此。

1428
01:04:49.100 --> 01:04:52.760
But you can, years later, have James Spader play Robert California.
但几年后，你确实可以让詹姆斯·斯派德来演罗伯特·加利福尼亚。

1429
01:04:53.400 --> 01:04:56.340
And have Idris Elba come in and all these other people.
还有伊德里斯·艾尔巴以及其他所有人。

1430
01:04:56.340 --> 01:04:57.080
And Timothy Oliphant.
还有蒂莫西·奥利芬特。

1431
01:04:57.480 --> 01:04:59.440
And Kathy Bates.
还有凯西·贝茨。

1432
01:05:00.260 --> 01:05:01.940
Okay, but for now...
好吧，但目前为止……

1433
01:05:01.940 --> 01:05:04.880
For now, our integrity is intact, okay?
目前为止，我们的原则还没被破坏，对吧？

1434
01:05:04.880 --> 01:05:12.060
And Greg came up with this idea, this fix, that would not infect the reality of the show.
于是格雷格想出了这个点子，一个既能解决问题，又不会影响剧集真实性的方案。

1435
01:05:12.140 --> 01:05:16.880
And that was where the idea for Pam, Jim, and Andy to watch this pirated movie.
那就是让帕姆、吉姆和安迪去看这部盗版电影。

1436
01:05:17.440 --> 01:05:27.160
And I guess Terry Weinberg, who was one of our original executive producers, was now working as the executive vice president of NBC Entertainment.
我记得泰瑞·温伯格，我们最初的执行制片人之一，当时正在担任 NBC 娱乐公司的执行副总裁。

1437
01:05:27.160 --> 01:05:36.520
And Greg said that she was really instrumental in fighting, like, the kind of top brass at NBC to agree to this fix.
格雷格说，她在对抗 NBC 高层、争取让他们同意这个方案的过程中起到了关键作用。

1438
01:05:37.140 --> 01:05:38.140
They did.
他们确实同意了。

1439
01:05:38.680 --> 01:05:41.000
Jack Black was the first person to commit.
杰克·布莱克是第一个答应的人。

1440
01:05:41.000 --> 01:05:42.200
He was all in.
他非常支持。

1441
01:05:42.260 --> 01:05:43.260
He loved our show.
他很喜欢我们的剧。

1442
01:05:43.840 --> 01:05:44.800
Cloris Leachman.
克萝丽丝·利奇曼。

1443
01:05:45.600 --> 01:05:46.820
Amazing, by the way.
顺便说一句，她太棒了。

1444
01:05:47.140 --> 01:05:47.700
Amazing.
太棒了。

1445
01:05:48.180 --> 01:05:53.420
She heard a pitch on what the story would be, and she was like, yes, I am in.
她听了故事梗概后，就说，好，我加入。

1446
01:05:53.580 --> 01:05:56.160
And then finally, we got Jessica Alba.
最后，我们请到了杰西卡·阿尔芭。

1447
01:05:56.160 --> 01:06:05.760
So the movie is called Mrs. Albert Hannity, and Jack Black is playing Sam, Cloris Leachman is playing Lily, a.k.a.
这部电影叫《阿尔伯特·汉尼提夫人》，杰克·布莱克饰演山姆，克萝丽丝·利奇曼饰演莉莉，也就是奶奶，

1448
01:06:05.920 --> 01:06:08.700
Nana, and Jessica Alba plays Sophie.
而杰西卡·阿尔芭饰演索菲。

1449
01:06:08.980 --> 01:06:12.040
It's sort of a romantic love triangle story.
这算是一个浪漫的三角恋故事。

1450
01:06:12.360 --> 01:06:20.320
Yeah, Jack Black is dating or engaged to Jessica Alba's character, and she's introducing him to her grandmother.
对，杰克·布莱克在片中和杰西卡·阿尔芭的角色在约会或订婚，他正准备去见她的祖母。

1451
01:06:20.320 --> 01:06:22.560
And there's an instant connection.
而且他们之间有一种瞬间的默契。

1452
01:06:22.880 --> 01:06:26.040
I mean, they go to shake hands, and music starts playing.
我是说，他们刚要去握手，音乐就响起来了。

1453
01:06:26.400 --> 01:06:28.240
Yeah, there's some electricity there.
没错，确实有一种触电的感觉。

1454
01:06:28.420 --> 01:06:32.600
Well, I want you to know there were some alt ideas for this parody movie, Jenna.
嗯，珍娜，我想让你知道，这部恶搞电影其实还有一些备选方案。

1455
01:06:32.920 --> 01:06:33.280
Oh.
哦。

1456
01:06:33.280 --> 01:06:40.360
And I went back to the table read draft, not the shooting draft, just to see what it said in the table read.
我回去翻了剧本围读时的初稿，而不是拍摄定稿，就是想看看当时是怎么写的。

1457
01:06:40.520 --> 01:06:45.100
In the table read draft, the movie was going to be called Hang Glider Cop.
在围读初稿里，这部电影原本打算叫《滑翔翼警察》。

1458
01:06:45.580 --> 01:06:46.040
What?
什么？

1459
01:06:46.980 --> 01:06:56.860
And Jack Black would be a cop named Tanner that's kind of a rogue cop, and he gets, as punishment, sent over to the hang gliding division.
杰克·布莱克本来要演一个叫坦纳的警察，是个有点叛逆的警察，作为惩罚，他被派到了滑翔翼部门。

1460
01:06:57.340 --> 01:06:57.880
Okay.
好吧。

1461
01:06:57.880 --> 01:07:00.020
And now he's going to be a hang gliding cop.
现在他要当滑翔翼警察了。

1462
01:07:00.180 --> 01:07:01.340
A wacky comedy.
一部古怪的喜剧。

1463
01:07:01.560 --> 01:07:03.160
Like a cop comedy.
就像那种警察喜剧。

1464
01:07:03.460 --> 01:07:03.740
Okay.
好吧。

1465
01:07:04.140 --> 01:07:05.320
They didn't go with that one.
他们最后没选那个方案。

1466
01:07:06.300 --> 01:07:09.320
Probably getting a hang glider was too much of a project.
可能弄个滑翔翼工程量太大了。

1467
01:07:09.760 --> 01:07:11.360
Gosh, I'd love to see that movie.
天哪，我真想看那部电影。

1468
01:07:11.600 --> 01:07:12.720
Hang Glider Cop.
《滑翔翼警察》。

1469
01:07:13.040 --> 01:07:14.480
Jack Black, are you listening?
杰克·布莱克，你在听吗？

1470
01:07:14.700 --> 01:07:15.040
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1471
01:07:15.400 --> 01:07:16.260
HG Division.
滑翔翼部门。

1472
01:07:16.680 --> 01:07:19.140
We got more fan questions about this.
我们收到了更多关于此事的粉丝提问。

1473
01:07:19.420 --> 01:07:22.980
Livian G, Norit F, and Maddie L said,
利维安·G、诺里特·F和麦迪·L问：

1474
01:07:23.140 --> 01:07:26.680
Did we get to meet Jack Black, Cloris Leachman, or Jessica Alba?
我们有没有见到杰克·布莱克、克萝丽丝·利奇曼或者杰西卡·阿尔芭？

1475
01:07:27.720 --> 01:07:28.260
No.
没有。

1476
01:07:28.640 --> 01:07:30.820
We did not work the same days they worked.
我们和他们工作的日子不一样。

1477
01:07:31.060 --> 01:07:37.420
They filmed all of their stuff in one day at a private residence in West L.A.
他们所有戏份都是在西洛杉矶的一处私人住宅里一天拍完的。

1478
01:07:37.820 --> 01:07:39.780
The rest of us all had the day off.
我们其他人那天都休息。

1479
01:07:39.980 --> 01:07:42.380
They didn't even come to our base camp.
他们甚至都没来我们的基地营。

1480
01:07:42.540 --> 01:07:43.900
No, they were at a house.
没有，他们在另一栋房子里。

1481
01:07:44.100 --> 01:07:45.860
I looked it up on the call sheet.
我在通告单上查过了。

1482
01:07:46.020 --> 01:07:47.740
They started really early that day.
那天他们开工特别早。

1483
01:07:48.000 --> 01:07:54.160
On the call sheet, it said breakfast would be ready for the crew at 4.42 a.m.
通告单上写着，剧组的早餐在凌晨4点42分准备好。

1484
01:07:54.280 --> 01:07:55.380
in a nearby park.
在附近的一个公园里。

1485
01:07:55.380 --> 01:07:55.960
Oof.
呜呼。

1486
01:07:56.160 --> 01:07:58.240
They had to get everything in one day.
他们必须在一天内拍完所有内容。

1487
01:07:58.480 --> 01:07:58.760
Yeah.
是啊。

1488
01:07:58.980 --> 01:08:00.920
The actors all arrived really early.
演员们都到得很早。

1489
01:08:01.200 --> 01:08:05.440
They did their hair, makeup, and wardrobe fittings all in the morning.
他们早上就完成了发型、化妆和服装试装。

1490
01:08:05.820 --> 01:08:12.000
And then they were finally allowed to go into the neighborhood where the house was located at 7 a.m.
然后他们直到早上7点才被允许进入那栋房子所在的社区。

1491
01:08:12.000 --> 01:08:17.000
So they had vans that took everyone from this park base camp over to the location.
所以他们有专门的货车把所有人从公园的基地营送到拍摄地点。

1492
01:08:17.440 --> 01:08:19.740
And that's where they filmed it.
那就是他们拍摄的地方。

1493
01:08:20.000 --> 01:08:21.200
So we never met.
所以我们从未见过面。

1494
01:08:21.420 --> 01:08:27.240
So while they're watching Mrs. Albert Hannity, we start seeing Pam getting all these text messages.
当他们在看阿尔伯特·汉尼提夫人时，我们开始看到帕姆收到了所有这些短信。

1495
01:08:27.580 --> 01:08:32.880
And we learn this storyline that Pam's parents are in a rough patch.
我们得知了帕姆的父母正处于感情危机中这一剧情线。

1496
01:08:33.340 --> 01:08:37.320
Yes, and that Pam's dad is bunking with Jim and Pam.
是的，而且帕姆的爸爸正借住在吉姆和帕姆家。

1497
01:08:37.800 --> 01:08:43.000
It is really funny, though, that Jim and Pam are having these little sidebar relationship conversations.
不过，吉姆和帕姆在旁边进行这些私下的感情对话，真的很有趣。

1498
01:08:43.000 --> 01:08:44.880
And Andy thinks it's about the movie.
而安迪以为他们在讨论电影。

1499
01:08:45.160 --> 01:08:45.300
Yeah.
没错。

1500
01:08:45.420 --> 01:08:47.900
Andy thinks you guys are just like geniuses at relationships.
安迪以为你们俩在处理感情问题上简直是天才。

1501
01:08:48.080 --> 01:08:50.100
That you can just figure all this stuff out.
你能把这一切都搞清楚。

1502
01:08:50.300 --> 01:08:55.120
Well, something else I should mention, Angela, is that we were actually watching this movie.
对了，安吉拉，我还有件事要提，就是我们当时其实是在看这部电影。

1503
01:08:55.200 --> 01:08:56.860
That's one of my questions for you.
这也是我要问你的问题之一。

1504
01:08:56.860 --> 01:09:01.400
So I was like, ask Jenna, were they actually watching the movie on the laptop?
所以我当时就想，问问珍娜，他们当时是真的在笔记本电脑上看电影吗？

1505
01:09:01.860 --> 01:09:02.760
So we were.
我们确实在看。

1506
01:09:02.960 --> 01:09:05.840
How could you not react to Chloris coming out of the tub?
你怎么可能对克洛里斯从浴缸里出来那一幕毫无反应呢？

1507
01:09:06.020 --> 01:09:07.840
You had to be distracted on your phone.
你当时肯定是在玩手机分心了。

1508
01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:09.320
I was like, holy crap.
我当时心想，天哪。

1509
01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:12.720
So they had shot this a long time ago.
所以他们是很久之前就拍好这一段了。

1510
01:09:12.720 --> 01:09:20.940
If you look at the call sheets for this episode, this bit of us in the conference room was not even on the schedule for these nine days.
如果你看这一集的通告单，我们坐在会议室里的这一小段戏，甚至都不在这一共九天的拍摄日程里。

1511
01:09:20.940 --> 01:09:30.220
Guys, we shot this another week later so that they could put together this mini movie so that we could have some reactions.
伙计们，我们是过了一周才补拍的，这样他们才能把这部微电影剪辑出来，我们才能做出相应的反应。

1512
01:09:30.720 --> 01:09:34.960
The first time they played them for us, we couldn't speak.
他们第一次给我们放的时候，我们都惊呆了，说不出话来。

1513
01:09:35.020 --> 01:09:36.220
We were riveted.
我们完全被吸引住了。

1514
01:09:36.420 --> 01:09:38.020
We were like, what are we watching?
我们当时想，我们到底在看什么？

1515
01:09:38.060 --> 01:09:39.240
That was what I thought.
我当时就是这么想的。

1516
01:09:39.360 --> 01:09:44.160
I was like, how can Jim and Pam, like, not just be falling out of their chairs right now?
我心想，吉姆和帕姆怎么可能现在还没从椅子上跌下来？

1517
01:09:44.280 --> 01:09:47.220
And Andy's like, guys, they're making out.
安迪却说，伙计们，他们正在亲热呢。

1518
01:09:47.220 --> 01:09:59.180
Like, so what they did was they showed it to us and then we watched a blank screen, but we knew what we were supposed to be reacting to.
所以他们做的是，先给我们放一遍，然后我们对着空白屏幕演，但我们知道自己该对什么做出反应。

1519
01:09:59.240 --> 01:10:00.320
You knew the beats of it.
你们知道剧情的节奏。

1520
01:10:00.380 --> 01:10:00.740
Yes.
是的。

1521
01:10:00.900 --> 01:10:01.060
Yeah.
没错。

1522
01:10:01.180 --> 01:10:04.320
And then they inserted it into the screen.
然后他们再把画面合成到屏幕里。

1523
01:10:04.520 --> 01:10:06.700
You know, if you notice, it's all over the shoulder.
你知道，如果你注意看的话，镜头全都是越肩拍摄的。

1524
01:10:06.840 --> 01:10:07.480
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
对，对，对。

1525
01:10:07.520 --> 01:10:07.880
Onto the thing.
对着那个东西拍。

1526
01:10:07.900 --> 01:10:09.360
I was very curious about that.
我对此非常好奇。

1527
01:10:09.520 --> 01:10:10.840
Yeah, it was bonkers.
是啊，太疯狂了。

1528
01:10:11.380 --> 01:10:16.400
Well, after all the texting with Pam's mom and dad, Pam says, Jim, can you talk to my dad?
在和帕姆的父母发了一通短信后，帕姆说，吉姆，你能跟我爸谈谈吗？

1529
01:10:16.400 --> 01:10:18.480
God, you're so good at talking to people.
天哪，你真擅长跟人沟通。

1530
01:10:18.480 --> 01:10:19.760
Yeah, maybe he'll open up to you.
是啊，也许他会向你敞开心扉。

1531
01:10:19.880 --> 01:10:20.160
Yeah.
嗯。

1532
01:10:20.580 --> 01:10:23.100
This is not going to go the way Pam planned.
这事儿可不会按帕姆计划的那样发展。

1533
01:10:23.280 --> 01:10:23.620
Yeah.
是啊。

1534
01:10:23.980 --> 01:10:25.340
But that's for next week.
但那是下周的事了。

1535
01:10:25.680 --> 01:10:30.960
Well, before we close out this episode, Michael has decided to do yoga in the conference room.
在结束这一集之前，迈克尔决定在会议室里做瑜伽。

1536
01:10:31.200 --> 01:10:32.240
For relaxation.
为了放松。

1537
01:10:32.880 --> 01:10:36.460
It did really make me laugh when he was like, um, if you have your legs open, close them.
当他说“嗯，如果你双腿张开，请合上”的时候，我真的笑喷了。

1538
01:10:36.540 --> 01:10:41.220
No one needs to see that, um, or whatever he said cracked me up.
没人想看那个，或者他说的其他什么话，都让我笑得不行。

1539
01:10:41.240 --> 01:10:46.220
It also really made me laugh when Jim says to Pam, don't open your eyes.
当吉姆对帕姆说“别睁开眼睛”时，也真的让我笑个不停。

1540
01:10:46.400 --> 01:10:47.620
And she says, why?
然后她说，为什么？

1541
01:10:47.760 --> 01:10:48.460
Oh, God.
哦，天哪。

1542
01:10:48.820 --> 01:10:51.900
I don't know if you noticed Dwight and Angela are laying side by side.
不知道你有没有注意到德怀特和安吉拉并排躺着。

1543
01:10:52.200 --> 01:10:52.640
Oh.
哦。

1544
01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:57.420
Yeah, that's because there was a deleted scene where Dwight whispers to her,
是啊，那是因为有一个删减片段，德怀特对她耳语说：

1545
01:10:57.620 --> 01:11:02.920
I will make love to you the way I used to if you will sign my apology letter.
“如果你肯签我的道歉信，我就像以前那样和你亲热。”

1546
01:11:02.980 --> 01:11:04.560
And she's like, ah, no.
然后她说，啊，不行。

1547
01:11:05.940 --> 01:11:06.380
Wow.
哇。

1548
01:11:06.740 --> 01:11:11.640
Well, during all of this, Stanley has a little heart monitor on and it beeps whenever he gets stressed.
在这一切发生期间，斯坦利戴着一个小型心率监测器，只要他一紧张就会发出哔哔声。

1549
01:11:11.640 --> 01:11:15.360
Turns out every time Michael gets close to him, it starts beeping.
结果每次迈克尔靠近他，监测器就开始响。

1550
01:11:15.620 --> 01:11:17.460
And then when Michael walks away, it stops.
然后当迈克尔走开时，它就停了。

1551
01:11:18.000 --> 01:11:21.040
So Michael has this very funny talking head where he says,
迈克尔有个非常有趣的访谈片段，他说，

1552
01:11:21.240 --> 01:11:24.420
it turns out that Dwight wasn't the killer after all.
结果证明德怀特根本不是凶手。

1553
01:11:24.560 --> 01:11:25.620
The killer was Michael.
凶手是迈克尔。

1554
01:11:26.040 --> 01:11:29.420
And he says, quote, you never suspect you're the killer.
他说，引用原话，你永远不会怀疑自己就是凶手。

1555
01:11:29.760 --> 01:11:31.100
It's a great twiSt.
这真是个绝妙的反转。

1556
01:11:31.300 --> 01:11:32.260
Great twiSt.
绝妙的反转。

1557
01:11:32.840 --> 01:11:37.090
My gosh, you guys, that was stress relief part one.
天哪，伙计们，那是《压力释放》的第一部分。

1558
01:11:37.310 --> 01:11:37.890
I know.
我知道。

1559
01:11:38.270 --> 01:11:38.810
We did it.
我们做到了。

1560
01:11:38.810 --> 01:11:40.530
Next week is part two.
下周是第二部分。

1561
01:11:40.750 --> 01:11:41.190
Boom.
砰。

1562
01:11:41.370 --> 01:11:41.890
Roasted.
被吐槽了。

1563
01:11:42.550 --> 01:11:43.610
That's next week.
那是下周的内容。

1564
